        "id": "mwu46bgr2h6td",
        "layout": "naming",
        "notes": {
          "en": "Keep it light: “Before the lineup, a 30-second decoder ring. Once you know a few letters, the whole chart reads itself.”\nClick AX45MPV: A = application processor (Linux), X = 64-bit, 45 = the series, MP = multicore, V = vector.\nInvite them to pick a name they know (e.g. D25F-SE) and decode it together.\nStress: the number names a series, not pipeline depth, clock speed or core count. FPU precision, VLEN/DLEN, cache size and ASIL are confirmed per model and configuration.",
          "ko": ""
        },
        "data": {
          "title": {
            "en": "How to read an AndesCore™ name",
            "ko": "AndesCore™ 제품명 읽는 법"
          },
          "lead": {
            "en": "Prefixes set the role. Suffixes flag features.",
            "ko": "접두어는 역할을, 접미어는 기능을 나타냅니다."
          },
          "inputLabel": {
            "en": "Enter or select a model",
            "ko": "모델명을 입력하거나 선택하십시오"
          },
          "steps": [
            {
              "t": {
                "en": "Identify the N / A / D role",
                "ko": "N / A / D 역할 확인"
              }
            },
